The private source-only pytest child is exact old004 child bytes. It uses direct frozen base -I-S-B-Xutf8, explicit pytest9.1.1 site, plugin autoload/cache off, one thread, fresh short .tmp/raw4-005 TEMP/TMP/TMPDIR and copied source cwd. The future raw suite permits reviewed private scratch Git subprocess fixtures and scoped Windows native metadata/FFI probes. No real native ceremony, live Git mutation/commit, fit, Torch, source apply or release is authorized. Two named symlink tests may qualify as skips only on their actual Win1314 privilege outcome. All58 test function names are prepared AST facts, not an actual node count. Collection/IDs/JUnit/results are derived fresh; maxfail1 leaves later nodes unrun on failure.

Collection wait60s, test wait300s and owned direct-child cleanup wait60s yield a420s local phase allowance, with ROOT direct-driver wait450s. Driver requires570s ACK expiry reserve for its450s plus120s capture/closeout allowance. These are local wait controls, not guaranteed hard wall limits for IO/guard work/capture drains/process trees. ROOT450 kill targets its direct driver only; owned-child waits retain direct handle evidence. No Job, descendant cleanup, full site/Lib/DLL loaded closure or OS write sandbox is claimed.

Before/after whole observer retains exact globally mixed D/F UTF16 Ordinal native digest, root excluded, for frozen base and venv Scripts twice. All4 current runtime files are independently selected after review. The two whole trees are external time-local metadata observations; driver authenticates their pins/age and does not itself freshly reread every global-tree file. Independent after byte/path/descriptor/directory/root metadata reconciliation remains required for runtime acceptance. No before/after capture ran in preparation.

